        path('api/products/', include('products.urls')),
        path('api/users/',    include('users.urls')),
        path('api/orders/',   include('orders.urls')),
  - Kept /admin/ for Django admin (still routed separately).
  - Kept static() for /media/ in DEBUG mode.

